                        "sense_id": "3653d4e1-cf14-3c11-9687-23394780c82b",
                        "entry_id": "533cba15-6561-34b7-9942-87660ee23e9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A headboard of a bed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac351dc6-5fad-4cc0-833d-0535b9d71c35",
                                "sense_id": "3653d4e1-cf14-3c11-9687-23394780c82b",
                                "text": "Wooden beds were made as replicas of large ones, some carved in walnut, others in magohany and with elaborate head-pieces. There were four-posters draped with curtains to pull and bedspreads to match, much beautiful hand-sewing and embroidery going to their manufacture."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff73d90f-8ac5-3ef2-8a0d-d75dcf67d6c6",
                        "entry_id": "533cba15-6561-34b7-9942-87660ee23e9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A decorative page heading used at the start of volumes or chapters."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f3a9990-e902-43b6-a3d5-9cd73751162a",
                                "sense_id": "ff73d90f-8ac5-3ef2-8a0d-d75dcf67d6c6",
                                "text": "A view of a Wenford train headed by this locomotive forms the headpiece to the present article."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "68db32b8-8e8c-3015-be51-9fd0251c58c1",
                        "entry_id": "533cba15-6561-34b7-9942-87660ee23e9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The top piece or part of any of various things."
